{"id":"vod_md_3050","vodId":"3050","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"加速世界","name_cn":"加速世界","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230823-1/783ef66428d0de69e121f1314620ba22.jpg"},"summary":"现代社会之中，校园欺凌事件屡禁不止，成为学校和社会的难题。身材肥胖个性内向的有田春雪（梶裕贵 配音）便是长期欺凌的受害者。性格懦弱的春雪无法反抗欺凌者，唯有躲在网络之后，靠玩躲避球游戏来发泄愤怒。一来二去之间，春雪竟然成为了校园内躲避球游戏得分第一位。有着“黑雪公主”之称的学生会副会长黑雪姬（三泽纱千香 配音）出现在了春日的面前，黑雪姬不仅制止了对于春雪的欺凌，更邀请他进入了名为“Brain Buster”的方程式，在其中，春日化身成为拥有千倍思考速度的超频连线者，被卷入了激烈的战斗之中。黑雪姬召集春日等人的目的只有一个，那就是重组昔日“黑之王”的军团。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-23 08:55:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/vkz2fyft/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/DFfXVkXJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/BkEfXGmo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/LA3E3ojm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/SIvgHqcL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/kb9K8eEx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/DQYjmhK7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/tCLezR5N/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/iP5uNChd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/W8TP6oQs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/xqGGLM7l/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/qJMmEp7Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/XPZfcshr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/ZlVG0cQf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/YmvWQZUC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","u